@context: Mouse, keyboard, waits, shadow DOM, scrolling containers, JS dialogs and custom controls on non-standard widgets.
@title: widgets
@tags: regression, widgets

STEP 1: Waits
    NAVIGATE to {base_url}/widgets.html
    WAIT FOR 'Loading widgets...' to disappear
    CLICK the 'Reveal panel' button
    WAIT FOR SELECTOR '.lazy-panel'
    WAIT FOR 'Panel ready' to be visible
    WAIT 0.2

STEP 2: Mouse
    DRAG 'Card A' and drop it into 'Done column'
    VERIFY that 'Card A moved to Done' is present
    HOVER over the 'Profile'
    VERIFY that 'Signed in as Manul' is present
    DOUBLE CLICK the 'Copy Text' button
    VERIFY that 'Copied!' is present
    RIGHT CLICK the 'Context Area'
    CLICK the 'Rename' button
    VERIFY that 'Renamed!' is present

STEP 3: Keyboard
    FILL 'Shortcut box' field with 'hello'
    PRESS Enter
    VERIFY that 'Enter pressed' is present
    PRESS Control+A ON 'Shortcut box'
    VERIFY that 'Select all pressed' is present
    CLICK the 'Open dialog' button
    VERIFY that 'Modal is open' is present
    PRESS Escape
    VERIFY that 'Modal is open' is NOT present

STEP 4: Dialogs are accepted automatically
    CLICK the 'Show alert' button
    VERIFY that 'Alert accepted' is present

STEP 5: Scrolling
    SCROLL DOWN inside the 'Product List'
    VERIFY that 'Product 40' is present
    SCROLL DOWN
    SCROLL UP

STEP 6: Shadow DOM
    TYPE 'from the shadows' into the 'Shadow Field' field
    VERIFY that 'Echo: from the shadows' is present

STEP 7: Custom controls
    # {signer} comes from the before_all hook (or set_vars in scripts).
    CLICK the 'Signature Pad'
    VERIFY that 'Signed by {signer}' is present
    SELECT '4' from the 'Star Rating' dropdown
    VERIFY that 'Rating: 4' is present

DONE.
